Route5_SouthEntrance_Text_HothouseReferral::
	.string "Hey, kid! That drink? Beautiful.\p"
	.string "Listen, I got a buddy Hawthorne\n"
	.string "over at the Hothouse.\p"
	.string "Guy's losin' his mind over some\n"
	.string "giant leafy POKéMON.\p"
	.string "You wanna make yourself useful,\n"
	.string "tell him I sent ya.\p"
	.string "And don't make me look bad,\n"
	.string "capisce?$"
